# Changes summary (client notes — mandatory)

After completing **any** change — **before marking Done** — update the **client** day file.

## One place only (not in this web repo)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `techhind-solar-api/docs/changes/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | **Only** day file |
| `techhind-solar-api/docs/CHANGES_SUMMARY.md` | Index (newest first) |

Do **not** keep a separate web/FE changes log. Front-end and back-end do not matter for this document.

## Audience = Client

- Simple words; functional outcome only.
- **No** file paths, code, routes, or “frontend/backend” wording.

## Format

```markdown
## Fixes | Improvements | New
- **Short title** — what the user gains or what was fixed.
```

Sequence: **Fixes → Improvements → New**.
